    "Dish asks GitHub for the newest release at startup and every few hours. See the privacy policy for what is sent." : {
      "comment" : "Settings toggle detail (the sibling sentence, tightened to fit a line).",
      "localizations" : {
        "bs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dish pri pokretanju i svakih nekoliko sati pita GitHub za najnovije izdanje. Šta se šalje, pročitajte u politici privatnosti."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dish fragt beim Start und alle paar Stunden bei GitHub nach der neuesten Version. Was gesendet wird, steht in der Datenschutzerklärung."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dish pregunta a GitHub por la versión más reciente al iniciarse y cada pocas horas. Consulta la política de privacidad para saber qué se envía."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dish demande à GitHub la version la plus récente au démarrage, puis toutes les quelques heures. La politique de confidentialité détaille ce qui est envoyé."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O Dish consulta o GitHub em busca da versão mais recente ao iniciar e a cada poucas horas. Veja na política de privacidade o que é enviado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dish closed unexpectedly last time. The report below has had your home folder, network addresses and key-like values removed." : {
      "comment" : "Crash report sheet intro (the sibling sentence, one word shorter to fit a line).",
      "localizations" : {
        "bs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dish se prošli put neočekivano zatvorio. Iz izvještaja ispod uklonjeni su vaš početni folder, mrežne adrese i sve vrijednosti nalik ključevima."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dish wurde beim letzten Mal unerwartet beendet. Aus dem Bericht unten wurden dein Home-Ordner, Netzwerkadressen und alle schlüsselartigen Werte entfernt."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dish se cerró inesperadamente la última vez. Al informe de abajo se le han quitado tu carpeta personal, las direcciones de red y cualquier valor que parezca una clave."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
